{"4196030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arena : Run And Hit", "steam_appid": 4196030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 10-player battle unfolds on a rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simple game of &quot;Arena: Run &amp; Hit&quot;—hitting and running away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After starting the game, wait for Steam to automatically log you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once logged in, you'll enter the lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the lobby, create your character using the character customization system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with others in a group or matching system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you prefer a scoring system, select Competitive Survival Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do I win?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Survival Mode, the last survivor wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Respawn Mode, the player with the most kills wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do I achieve good results?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically, mastering running and attack timing is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters have identical hitboxes, so there's no disadvantage or advantage to using different characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in battles that are fair and equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are the control keys?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By default, attack is with SPACE, and movement is with WASD (or the arrow keys).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize the controls by clicking the gear icon in the upper right corner of the lobby.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 10-player battle unfolds on a rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simple game of &quot;Arena: Run &amp; Hit&quot;—hitting and running away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After starting the game, wait for Steam to automatically log you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once logged in, you'll enter the lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the lobby, create your character using the character customization system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with others in a group or matching system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you prefer a scoring system, select Competitive Survival Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do I win?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Survival Mode, the last survivor wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Respawn Mode, the player with the most kills wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do I achieve good results?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically, mastering running and attack timing is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters have identical hitboxes, so there's no disadvantage or advantage to using different characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in battles that are fair and equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are the control keys?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By default, attack is with SPACE, and movement is with WASD (or the arrow keys).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize the controls by clicking the gear icon in the upper right corner of the lobby.</p>", "short_description": "A 10-player rooftop battle. Enjoy the simple game of &quot;Arena: Run &amp; Hit,&quot; where you simply hit and run away. The last player standing among the 10 players wins. You can battle on the rooftops with friends through the group, or compete with others through the competition to determine rankings.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196030/994c0dfe4401846b74d0b138889e283d5f51ea26/header.jpg?t=1765306493", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196030/b1c0a34a1399dec71c40e90fc8122466cfbb386b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765306493", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196030/b1c0a34a1399dec71c40e90fc8122466cfbb386b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765306493", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["AhwhiStudio"], "publishe